@startuml
'==== Title ====
title "As a User, I want to use a Web UI to put for %n()sale a publication in my library in a direct sale." %n() Process View SD Level 1

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox
autonumber

' ==== Actor and participants ====
actor "User" as U
participant ":MiteLovers" as System

U -> System : I want to put an item %n()in my library on direct sale
activate System
System --> U : Displays direct sale form %n() with items NotOnSale only
deactivate System

U -> System : Submit selected itemId, price, %n()currency, and time limit

activate System
System --> U : The item was successfully %n()put on direct sale.

@enduml

@enduml